# TextTools screenshots

- Do not capture the screen in this agent. Start one subagent with `.cursor/skills/texttools-screenshots/SKILL.md` and let it click. The capture script saves the window.
- The shot list is `docs/screenshots/catalog.yaml`. `packaging/screenshots/sync-catalog.ps1` appends a surface when a window, editor page, or settings tab appears. Do not add window names to this rule.
- The saved shot blurs the outer 5 pixels. Do not publish a key, a proxy password, or a DSN.
